        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, products that we design and sell based on current television series or new video game titles are expected to have a market demand depending on the popularity and longevity of the title, which is generally expected to be multiple years.",
        "start_character": 24545,
        "end_character": 24794
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we do not conduct the day-to-day manufacturing of our products, we are responsible for designing both the product and the packaging.",
        "start_character": 29427,
        "end_character": 29568
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we do not manufacture our products, we own most of the tools and molds used in the manufacturing process, and generally these are transferable among manufacturers if we choose to employ alternative manufacturers.",
        "start_character": 30760,
        "end_character": 30981
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, products that we design and sell based on these properties generally do not have a defined duration of market demand.",
        "start_character": 23757,
        "end_character": 23887
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we expand our business into new markets or introduce new features or offerings into existing markets, regulatory bodies or courts may claim that we are subject to additional requirements, or that we are prohibited from conducting business in certain jurisdictions.",
        "start_character": 41633,
        "end_character": 41900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because of the strength of our in-house creative team, we are able to move from product design to pre-selling a new product in as few as 24 hours.",
        "start_character": 27000,
        "end_character": 27146
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Domestically, we sell our products to specialty retailers, mass-market retailers and e-commerce sites.",
        "start_character": 31065,
        "end_character": 31167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to major retailers, we also sell our products to distributors for sale to specialized retailers in the United States and in certain countries internationally, typically where we do not currently have a direct presence.",
        "start_character": 31481,
        "end_character": 31711
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to offering multiple properties and product categories, we create and sell a variety of unique brands that have their own look and feel.",
        "start_character": 9066,
        "end_character": 9214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our full-time sales staff, we also retain several independent sales representatives to sell and promote our products both domestically and internationally.",
        "start_character": 33095,
        "end_character": 33265
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, our license agreements usually require us to obtain the licensor’s approval of products we develop under the license prior to making any sales.",
        "start_character": 22178,
        "end_character": 22334
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001704711-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001704711-26-000020-f94f76d43d260043",
        "accession_number": "0001704711-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we also develop product lines that we market under the broader Funko brand, such as Funko action figures, Funko Soda, and Funko Plush product lines.",
